<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:18:51.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18605,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "<div style=\"\n  position:relative;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  border-radius:12px;\n  padding:12px 14px;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  color:#222;\n  line-height:1.5;\n  max-width:600px;\n\">\n  <!-- Tail -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position:absolute;\n    left:14px;\n    bottom:-7px;\n    width:14px; height:14px;\n    background:#fff;\n    transform:rotate(45deg);\n    border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  \"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:20px;\">Sparky here to share how AI works!<br><br><strong>Artificial Intelligence (AI)</strong> refers to systems that learn patterns from data and use them to make predictions, generate content, or solve problems.\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c2d0383806b5f2c6e64944f0f4a647a3-Screenshot 2025-10-20 at 1.45.28 PM.png",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_-pl-26827f86-0270-42eb-8cc8-075cc731eae3",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "<div style=\"\n  position:relative;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  border-radius:12px;\n  padding:12px 14px;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  color:#222;\n  line-height:1.5;\n  max-width:600px;\n\">\n  <!-- Tail -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position:absolute;\n    left:14px;\n    bottom:-7px;\n    width:14px; height:14px;\n    background:#fff;\n    transform:rotate(45deg);\n    border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  \"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:20px;\">\n    You already interact with AI every day — even if you don’t call it that. Examples include:\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:1.6;\">Autocorrect or predictive text that finishes your sentences</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:1.6;\">Music or video recommendations on Spotify, Netflix, or YouTube</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:1.6;\">Voice assistants like Siri or Alexa that recognize and respond to speech</li>\n</ul>\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/11e82ad45a9d28d14aebdd7475c6f892-Screenshot 2025-10-20 at 1.58.14 PM.png",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_XII-pl-6d9d7e1e-72e2-400c-a363-7990c8236d6a"
      },
      {
        "text": "<div style=\"\n  position:relative;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  border-radius:12px;\n  padding:12px 14px;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  color:#222;\n  line-height:1.5;\n  max-width:600px;\n\">\n  <!-- Tail -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position:absolute;\n    left:14px;\n    bottom:-7px;\n    width:14px; height:14px;\n    background:#fff;\n    transform:rotate(45deg);\n    border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  \"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:20px;\">\n    Modern AI doesn’t think or reason — it recognizes patterns at massive scale. <br><br>Trained on millions or billions of examples, AI models use math to find relationships between inputs and outputs.\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b2b359d550fd8b2020145dc841d90413-Screenshot 2025-10-20 at 1.58.19 PM.png",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_-pl-bfb56243-e440-4e17-92d5-3c7d4cfdd275"
      },
      {
        "text": "<div style=\"\n  position:relative;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  border-radius:12px;\n  padding:12px 14px;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  color:#222;\n  line-height:1.5;\n  max-width:600px;\n\">\n  <!-- Tail -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position:absolute;\n    left:14px;\n    bottom:-7px;\n    width:14px; height:14px;\n    background:#fff;\n    transform:rotate(45deg);\n    border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  \"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:20px;\">\n    When you ask a question or type a prompt, the AI doesn’t truly understand like a human would. <br><br>Instead, it compares your input to patterns it has seen before and produces a response that statistically fits. <br><br>Think of it as a super-fast pattern matcher, not a mind with understanding.\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f73d8849cad382b24d76d646e71618de-Screenshot 2025-10-20 at 1.58.23 PM.png",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_-pl-61bcf404-e424-4df1-a858-bffad1b4d484"
      },
      {
        "text": "<div style=\"\n  position:relative;\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  border-radius:12px;\n  padding:12px 14px;\n  box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  color:#222;\n  line-height:1.5;\n  max-width:600px;\n\">\n  <!-- Tail -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position:absolute;\n    left:14px;\n    bottom:-7px;\n    width:14px; height:14px;\n    background:#fff;\n    transform:rotate(45deg);\n    border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  \"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:20px;\">\n    AI “learns” through repetition and feedback: it makes predictions, checks how far off it was, and adjusts its internal settings (called <strong>parameters</strong>) to improve. <br><br>Once trained, it can generalize and create new text, images, or ideas from the patterns it has learned.\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2e4a1a157bb107de8e4d435a855cf010-Screenshot 2025-10-20 at 1.58.27 PM.png",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_-pl-a0504e03-ae45-4898-83db-b0c7a3b5e7af"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_-pl"
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-14T17:18:51.774+00:00\",\"changed\":[\"cloned from \\\"HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_-pl\\\"\"],\"cloned_from\":\"HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info_-pl\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-14 17:37:06 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-14 17:55:07 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-14 17:55:24 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-15 18:41:42 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-15 18:47:12 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-15 18:50:01 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 16:47:39 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 17:06:11 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 17:07:35 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 17:08:21 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 17:20:56 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 17:22:12 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"changed_by_email\":\"micah.kennedy@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 17:27:39 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":19151,\"c